# {{.ID}} (Pyro plugin)

Fetch the SDK once:

    go mod tidy

Then build, install and rebuild on every save (a running `pyro serve` picks changes up):

    pyro plugin dev .

Try one call of the installed plugin:
{{if eq .Kind "protocol"}}
    pyro plugin test {{.ID}} --url {{.ID}}://localhost:1234 --body hello
{{else if eq .Kind "auth"}}
    pyro plugin test {{.ID}} --url https://api.example.com/orders --body '{}' --param secret=s3cret
{{else}}
    pyro plugin test {{.ID}} --phase post --status 200
{{end}}
Or build and install by hand:

    GOOS=wasip1 GOARCH=wasm go build -buildmode=c-shared -o {{.ID}}.wasm .
    pyro plugin install .

Package for sharing (prints the sha256 for an index entry):

    pyro plugin pack .

See docs/plugins.md in the Pyro repository for the SDK and ABI.
